{
  "_doc": "Studio experiments for tools/studio/sim.py. kind = race | escape | match; opts go to TestHarness.Runner (runRace / runEscape / runMatch). checks: finishAll, maxRespawns (per car), winnerTime [min, max] (warning only, Constants.FUN_TARGETS; only on the *-builds races, where the fastest build stands in for a race winner), stuck (escape: max stuck cases), finishRate (match), allJoined (match). match farming checks (stopAfter CRAFTING): ledger (inventory sizes match pickups/steals), everyonePicks, everyoneCrafted, noRejected, autoFor [farm profiles], minAttempts / maxAttempts {result: n} over steal attempts. vehicles checks: stuck, maxTilt (degrees), minTopSpeedRatio (of seat MaxSpeed). Tags: vehicles (~10 min), farm (farming + crafting, ~25 min), smoke (3 races, ~10 min), core (smoke + escape + match, ~45 min), full (everything).",
